{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hex Love - is Action Puzzle Game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features many unique levels where you need to solve various puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At each level, you make your way from the starting platform to the final one by solving puzzles and overcoming traps along the way. On the final platform, your love awaits you\u2014ready to motivate you in tough moments or give you helpful advice</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game has simple graphics that won\u2019t distract you from figuring out puzzle solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you enjoy games that make you think and occasionally test your reflexes, this game will be a perfect fit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559340/extras/2025-03-13_12-42-02.gif?t=1752666421\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2559340?t=1752666421","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559340/d4a54b97206c0419348ebda3835919c779fee985/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752666421","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559340/8949341f4fd3f3f3096de0d6ac1713d3dcf0d946/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752666421","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559340/8949341f4fd3f3f3096de0d6ac1713d3dcf0d946/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752666421","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hex Love - is Action Puzzle Game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features many unique levels where you need to solve various puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At each level, you make your way from the starting platform to the final one by solving puzz